00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:44.710 line:90%
for example,

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:45.600 line:90%
can be quite safe

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:46.980 line:90%
because of the air purification

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.630 line:90%
systems what we really worry

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:49.680 line:90%
about is the mingling

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:51.150 line:90%
of different bubbles once you

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:53.040 line:90%
