Thanksgiving we saw a mixed

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:55.920 line:90%
picture in the Midwest

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:58.050 line:90%
and in the northern plains cases

00:00:58.050 --> 00:00:59.670 line:90%
continue to go down despite

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:01.080 line:90%
the travel which meant that

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:02.820 line:90%
people really did the kinds

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:03.720 line:90%
of things we talked to them

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:05.220 line:90%
about like wearing a mask

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:06.400 line:90%
and limiting you're gathering

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:07.310 line:90%
so we really have to wait

00:01:07.310 --> 00:01:08.110 line:90%
and see.

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:09.240 line:90%
I really encourage people

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:11.070 line:90%
to follow the CDC guidelines

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:12.360 line:90%
make your family gatherings

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:14.620 line:90%
small safe protect the elderly.

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:16.210 line:90%
And we can get through this.

00:01:16.210 --> 00:01:17.280 line:90%
There are concerns about a new

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:18.660 line:90%
variant or mutations

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:19.950 line:90%
of the virus in places like

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:22.170 line:90%
the United Kingdom Japan even

00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:24.120 line:90%
Canada Ontario's chief medical

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:25.860 line:90%
officer announced Saturday that

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:27.360 line:90%
they had confirmed two cases

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:28.940 line:90%
they're considering global

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:29.740 line:90%
travel.

00:01:29.740 --> 00:01:31.500 line:90%
Do you think this new strain is

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:33.155 line:90%
now here in the United States.

00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:37.410 line:90%
Well we don't know if it's here

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:39.090 line:90%
or not we would say that

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:40.680 line:90%
there's certainly a possibility

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:41.760 line:90%
that it's here already

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:43.140 line:90%
because of global travel

00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:44.430 line:90%
and it's in so many countries

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:45.570 line:90%
now let me tell you what we know

00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:48.480 line:90%
about the strain it is number

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:50.640 line:90%
one it is not any more serious

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:52.380 line:90%
than the normal strains of covid

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:54.330 line:90%
however it does appear to be

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:56.040 line:90%
more transmissible there's not

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:57.310 line:90%
direct evidence of that.

00:01:57.310 --> 00:01:58.440 line:90%
But there's lots of suggestive

00:01:58.440 --> 00:02:00.190 line:90%
evidence but again you can still

00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:00.990 line:90%
protect yourself

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:02.580 line:90%
by the mitigation measures

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:03.930 line:90%
and we have no evidence

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:06.330 line:90%
to suggest nor do we believe

00:02:06.330 --> 00:02:07.710 line:90%
that this vaccine that

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:09.230 line:90%
the vaccine would not be

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:10.030 line:90%
effective.

00:02:10.030 --> 00:02:11.160 line:90%
In other words, we do believe

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:12.870 line:90%
the vaccine will be effective

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:14.100 line:90%
against this variant

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.530 line:90%
so that's why we're so excited

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:17.820 line:90%
and still very enthusiastic

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:19.590 line:90%
about the vaccine program which

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:21.250 line:90%
is being rolled out on time,

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:23.760 line:90%
on schedule with almost 15

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:25.140 line:90%
and a half million doses being

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:26.730 line:90%
distributed by this week

00:02:26.730 --> 00:02:28.650 line:90%
upcoming the United States is

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:30.180 line:90%
requiring negative tests from

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:31.950 line:90%
travelers coming from the United

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:33.720 line:90%
Kingdom do we need that

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:35.700 line:90%
elsewhere is that enough at this

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:38.110 line:90%
point.

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:41.220 line:90%
So I think what's often not

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:43.230 line:90%
talked about is since March

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:44.820 line:90%
there's been a very substantial

00:02:44.820 --> 00:02:46.890 line:90%
travel restriction on UK

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:48.350 line:90%
and a variety of countries from

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:49.150 line:90%
from Europe.

00:02:49.150 --> 00:02:51.240 line:90%
So since March, we have had

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:54.330 line:90%
a decrease of 92 95%

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:56.340 line:90%
