00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:00.730 line:90%
the pandemic is essentially over

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:01.900 line:90%
now there could be pockets

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:02.920 line:90%
in certain places where

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:04.570 line:90%
their vaccine hesitancy

00:08:04.570 --> 00:08:07.660 line:90%
and people don't get vaccinated

00:08:07.660 --> 00:08:08.740 line:90%
the truth is nobody knows

00:08:08.740 --> 00:08:10.690 line:90%
exactly the number but based

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:12.520 line:90%
on mathematical models as we

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:13.900 line:90%
have it right now it is

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:16.270 line:90%
somewhere between 70% and 80%

00:08:16.270 --> 00:08:18.160 line:90%
of individuals having gotten

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:19.780 line:90%
the vaccine or having gotten

00:08:19.780 --> 00:08:21.340 line:90%
the natural infection now

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:22.780 line:90%
obviously we want to develop

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:24.250 line:90%
Herd immunity by people getting

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:25.630 line:90%
the vaccine

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:26.770 line:90%
because they're at no risk

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:27.820 line:90%
of ill health effects

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:28.870 line:90%
or spreading it to other

00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:30.520 line:90%
individuals somewhere in that

00:08:30.520 --> 00:08:32.650 line:90%
70% to 80% range is probably

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:34.480 line:90%
the sweet spot nobody knows

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:35.500 line:90%
for sure but based

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:37.240 line:90%
on mathematical models people

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:39.039 line:90%
kind of converge at that number

00:08:39.039 --> 00:08:40.120 line:90%
Admiral we're running out

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:42.070 line:90%
of time but final question when

00:08:42.070 --> 00:08:43.809 line:90%
do you expect that any American

00:08:43.809 --> 00:08:45.490 line:90%
who wants a vaccine should be

00:08:45.490 --> 00:08:49.150 line:90%
able to get the vaccine well we

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:50.830 line:90%
are clearly on schedule 20

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:54.430 line:90%
million vaccinations distributed

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:56.140 line:90%
by the First week in January we

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:57.430 line:90%
expect another 30 million

00:08:57.430 --> 00:08:59.320 line:90%
in January another $50 million

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:01.660 line:90%
in February and with the current

00:09:01.660 --> 00:09:03.160 line:90%
contracts even with just

00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:04.840 line:90%
the vaccines we have right now

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:06.080 line:90%
we still expect that any

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:06.880 line:90%
American

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:08.170 line:90%
who wants a vaccine can be

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:10.570 line:90%
vaccinated by June that's really

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:11.860 line:90%
very exciting that means

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:14.110 line:90%
a couple million people being

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:15.630 line:90%
able to be vaccinated by that

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:16.430 line:90%
time.

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:19.060 line:90%
So with good mitigation steps

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:20.680 line:90%
with increasing vaccinations

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:22.450 line:90%
particularly among those who are

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:23.420 line:90%
vulnerable.

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:25.570 line:90%
We should see clearly light

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:26.810 line:90%
at the end of the tunnel.

00:09:26.810 --> 00:09:28.090 line:90%
But we've got to keep discipline

00:09:28.090 --> 00:09:29.530 line:90%
got to keep vigilant right now

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:31.290 line:90%
as we vaccinate Admiral thank

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:32.090 line:90%
you for joining us.

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:33.500 line:90%
Thanks for your service.

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:35.350 line:90%
We wish you a happy and very

00:09:35.350 --> 00:09:37.440 line:90%
healthy new year.

